        "product_summary": "Graphic colour directions: White/Green and White/Blue combine gradient panels with curved side graphics, while Black/White offers a contrasting neutral option.\n\nLace-up front: Visible eyelet rows allow the fastening to be adjusted across the instep.\n\nLayered sole profile: Curved sidewall grooves and a contrasting band define the low-top athletic casual silhouette.\n\nRear entry details: A low-cut opening and a heel pull loop provide a place to grip the shoe when putting it on.\n\nWholesale assortment: All three options are listed in EU39-44. Send colour-size quantities, packing preference and destination for an order quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
